#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:2
msgid "How to manage organization owners and teams"
msgstr "如何管理组织所有者和团队"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/shared/admonition-rtd-business.rst:2
msgid ""
"This feature is only available on `Read the Docs Business "
"<https://app.readthedocs.com/>`_."
msgstr "此功能仅在 `Read the Docs Business <https://app.readthedocs.com/>`_ 上提供。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:6
msgid ""
"Read the Docs uses teams within an organization to group users and provide "
"permissions to projects. This guide will cover how to manage both "
"organization owners and team members. You can read more about organizations "
"and teams in our :doc:`/commercial/organizations` documentation."
msgstr ""
"Read the Docs 使用组织内的团队来分组用户并授予项目权限。本指南讲解如何管理组织所有者和团队成员。更多关于组织和团队的信息见我们的 "
":doc:`/commercial/organizations` 文档。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:11
msgid "Managing organization owners"
msgstr "管理组织所有者"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:13
msgid ""
"Organization owners have full administrative access to the organization and "
"all its projects. They can manage settings, teams, members, and other "
"owners."
msgstr "组织所有者对组织及其所有项目拥有完整的管理权限，可管理设置、团队、成员和其他所有者。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:17
msgid "Adding an owner to an organization"
msgstr "为组织添加所有者"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:19
msgid ""
"To grant someone full administrative access to your organization, add them "
"as an owner."
msgstr "要授予某人对组织的完整管理权限，将其添加为所有者。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:23
msgid "You must be an owner of the organization to add another owner."
msgstr "你必须是组织所有者才能添加另一位所有者。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:25
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:41
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:62
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:75
msgid "Follow these steps:"
msgstr "按以下步骤操作："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:27
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:43
msgid ""
"Navigate to the `organization management page "
"<https://app.readthedocs.com/organizations/choose/organization_detail/>`__."
msgstr ""
"前往 `organization management page "
"<https://app.readthedocs.com/organizations/choose/organization_detail/>`__ 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:28
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:44
msgid "Select your organization from the list."
msgstr "从列表中选择你的组织。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:29
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:45
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Settings --> Owners`."
msgstr "前往 :menuselection:`Settings --> Owners` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:30
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:32
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Invite owner`."
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`Invite owner` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:31
msgid "Enter the user's Read the Docs username or email address."
msgstr "输入该用户的 Read the Docs 用户名或邮箱地址。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:34
msgid "The user will receive an invitation and must accept it to become an owner."
msgstr "该用户会收到邀请，接受后即成为所有者。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:37
msgid "Removing an owner from an organization"
msgstr "从组织移除所有者"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:39
msgid "To revoke administrative access from an organization owner:"
msgstr "要撤销组织所有者的管理权限："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:46
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Remove owner` next to the owner you want to remove."
msgstr "点击要移除的所有者旁的 :guilabel:`Remove owner` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:50
msgid ""
"You cannot remove the last owner from an organization. There must always be "
"at least one owner."
msgstr "你不能移除组织的最后一位所有者，组织必须始终至少有一位所有者。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:54
msgid "Managing team members"
msgstr "管理团队成员"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:57
msgid "Adding a user to a team"
msgstr "为团队添加用户"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:59
msgid ""
"Adding a user to a team gives them all the permissions available to that "
"team, whether it's *read-only* or *admin*."
msgstr "为团队添加用户会赋予其该团队拥有的全部权限，无论该团队是*只读* 还是* 管理员* 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:64
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:77
msgid ""
"Navigate to the `teams management page "
"<https://app.readthedocs.com/organizations/choose/organization_team_list/>`__."
msgstr ""
"前往 `teams management page "
"<https://app.readthedocs.com/organizations/choose/organization_team_list/>`__"
" 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:65
msgid "Click on a :guilabel:`<team name>`."
msgstr "点击某个 :guilabel:`<team name>` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:66
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Invite Member`."
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`Invite Member` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:67
msgid "Input the user's Read the Docs username or email address."
msgstr "输入该用户的 Read the Docs 用户名或邮箱地址。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:68
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Add member`."
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`Add member` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:71
msgid "Removing a user from a team"
msgstr "从团队移除用户"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:73
msgid "Removing a user from a team removes all permissions that team gave them."
msgstr "从团队移除用户会撤销该团队授予其的全部权限。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:78
msgid "Click on :guilabel:`<team name>`."
msgstr "点击某个 :guilabel:`<team name>` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:79
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Remove` next to the user."
msgstr "点击该用户旁的 :guilabel:`Remove` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:83
msgid "Granting access to import a project"
msgstr "授予导入项目的权限"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:85
msgid ""
"Organization owners can import projects on any team. To let another user "
"import projects, make them a member of any team with *admin* permissions, "
"they will be granted access to import a project on that team."
msgstr "组织所有者可以在任意团队上导入项目。若要让其他用户导入项目，将他们设为某个具有*管理员* 权限团队的成员，他们将获得在该团队上导入项目的权限。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:90
msgid ""
"If your organization uses :ref:`single sign-on with a Git provider "
"<sso_git_provider>`, teams aren't used, and only organization owners can "
"import projects."
msgstr ""
"若你的组织使用 :ref:`single sign-on with a Git provider <sso_git_provider>` "
"，则不使用团队，只有组织所有者能导入项目。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:94
msgid "Automating team management"
msgstr "自动化团队管理"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:96
msgid ""
"You can manage teams more easily using our :doc:`single sign-on </commercial"
"/single-sign-on>` features."
msgstr "你可以使用我们的 :doc:`单点登录 </commercial/single-sign-on>` 功能更轻松地管理团队。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:100
msgid ":doc:`/commercial/organizations`"
msgstr ":doc:`/commercial/organizations`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:101
msgid "General information about the *organizations* feature."
msgstr "关于*组织* 功能的总体信息。"

